I do today to solve this problem?

00:06:02.870 --> 00:06:05.639
Now to give you the last one here, that was
the last one, but it's kind of leading to

00:06:05.639 --> 00:06:07.789
the fifth one, here's the fifth one.

00:06:07.789 --> 00:06:08.819
it works every single time.

00:06:08.819 --> 00:06:09.819
Are you ready?

00:06:09.819 --> 00:06:13.970
I'm in a bad mood, I had a bad conversation,
somebody upset me.

00:06:13.970 --> 00:06:17.020
I will take five minutes and make a list of
five people.

00:06:17.020 --> 00:06:19.490
I will literally make a list of five people.

00:06:19.490 --> 00:06:21.200
Once I make a list of those five people, you
know what I do?

00:06:21.200 --> 00:06:24.840
I call every one of those five people and
I tell them how amazing they are.

00:06:24.840 --> 00:06:25.840
And I talk about their gifts.

00:06:25.840 --> 00:06:28.330
I just want to tell you how grateful I am
for you.

00:06:28.330 --> 00:06:30.270
I just want to tell you how much I love you.

00:06:30.270 --> 00:06:32.380
I just want to tell you how amazing you are.

00:06:32.380 --> 00:06:34.820
You're one of the most talented people I know
in this area.

00:06:34.820 --> 00:06:37.480
I want to tell you you're one of the greatest
listeners I know.

00:06:37.480 --> 00:06:39.010
You've got an incredible heart.

00:06:39.010 --> 00:06:41.690
Five minutes later, everything is minuscule.

00:06:41.690 --> 00:06:42.690
But here's the great thing.

00:06:42.690 --> 00:06:44.000
You know what the great thing is?

00:06:44.000 --> 00:06:49.169
you just impacted five people's day, and they
got changed because of you, and they're going

00:06:49.169 --> 00:06:53.510
to be thinking about the impact you made in
their lives, and you're, in a way, you're

00:06:53.510 --> 00:06:55.000
